/banners/v4/episode/11231496/screencap/687e29cbf2a50.jpg"},{"title":"A Being More Perfect Than a Toy","synopsis":"After a science lab mishap, Dr. Mado unveils his latest creation: a super-intelligent robot made of slime!","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11231497/screencap/6886350205a31.jpg"},{"title":"Puniru Powers Up?! See It for Yourself!","synopsis":"Kotaro has big plans for the summer, but could he be his own worst enemy? Meanwhile, Puniru seeks to power up.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11231498/screencap/688f75ab9a014.jpg"},{"title":"A Human Happy Ending","synopsis":"Gelee becomes the center of attention among the school's boys, including Kotaro, much to Puniru's chagrin.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11231499/screencap/6898c1205c621.jpg"},{"title":"A Midsummer`s Runrune Resort","synopsis":"Alice invites Kotaro to stay at Runrune Resort, but all Kotaro can think about is Gelee and her advances.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11231500/screencap/68a1f7a72c467.jpg"},{"title":"Trick or Kawaii!","synopsis":"Gelee joins Kotaro's class as a student, to her chagrin. Meanwhile, Puniru plans a big surprise for Halloween.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11231501/screencap/68ac1bb73c78d.jpg"},{"title":"Art Is All About \"Kawaii\"!","synopsis":"Hodai hatches a scheme to discredit Kotaro in Alice's eyes by having him face Nanpa in an artistic face-off.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11231502/screencap/68b442c36aa4a.jpg"},{"title":"Friendly Enough to Always Argue","synopsis":"Kotaro gets into a big fight with Puniru, who runs away to Mami's apartment and meets the Kirara family.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11231503/screencap/68bdcd3236dc2.jpg"},{"title":"The Human Condition","synopsis":"Kotaro holds a study group with friends, but his careless remark to Gelee ends up having dire consequences.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11231504/screencap/68c90d92c4c91.jpg"},{"title":"That`s What the World Calls Love","synopsis":"Puniru turns into a perfect human girl, but Kotaro doesn't seem as happy to hear the news as everyone else.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11231505/screencap/68d033ef5eaa6.jpg"}],"fields":{},"episodes":{}}
